                        "review": "game is very very beautiful. puzzles are fun, interesting, and sort of specialized. I really like all the objects they expect you to know how to operate\r\n\r\nIt's not a long game, so the moments where you get stuck just allow you to experience the game for longer hehe. I wouldn't have it any other way. Although I'd recommend you go in with the expectation that some things will be persnickety.\r\n\r\nplaying the game in 2560 x 1440 resolution can cause some visual bugs, and I actually got an intense strobe light at one point. One that would be dangerous for people prone to seizures. IDK how it works, but playing in 1920 x 1080 resolution fixed this issue for me.",
